  "title": "After-tax entity comparison",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>After-tax entity comparison</h2><p>Compare two simplified structures using only the supplied rates and assumptions.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f1\">C corporation entity tax</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f2\">C corporation shareholder dividend tax</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f3\">After-tax owner cash under the C corporation model</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f4\">After-tax owner cash under the pass-through model</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs1-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
