  "explanation": "<h3>C corporation entity tax</h3><p>$300,000 × 21% = $63,000.</p><h3>C corporation shareholder dividend tax</h3><p>($300,000 − $63,000) × 15% = $35,550.</p><h3>After-tax owner cash under the C corporation model</h3><p>$300,000 − $63,000 − $35,550 = $201,450.</p><h3>After-tax owner cash under the pass-through model</h3><p>$300,000 × 70% = $210,000 under the simplified assumptions.</p>"
